.TH FBSTARTUPNOTIFY 1 "2026-09-10" "flux-tools 2.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
fbstartupnotify \- provide visual feedback during application startup
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fbstartupnotify
.RB [ false ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B fbstartupnotify
changes the mouse cursor to indicate application startup and automatically reverts it when a new window is detected. Provides visual feedback to users during application launching.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B false
Reset cursor to normal without waiting for new windows
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xsetroot (1),
.BR wmctrl (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Tomas-M <https://github.com/Tomas-M>
crims0n <crims0n@minios.dev>
.SH NOTES
Only one watcher runs per user and display. The cursor is restored when the window list changes or after at most ten seconds, including failed launches and applications that reuse an existing window.
